-- The set-hop image and in-degree (decision record setHop; spec §5, §9). Split from s05d-set-hop; twin of s05a-frenzy-image.bqn.
-- A world of eight fighters. Two are frenzied, and each holds a target set: fighter 0 swings at {3,4}, fighter 1 at {4,5}. In source position Frenzy.targets' selects the image — the union of the fibers, a mask. A mask has no multiplicity: fighter 4, targeted by both, takes the ;-batch once. Health row 4 is 90, not 80 — the idempotent scatter.
-- In-degree is a different quantity and lives in a different place: the gamma fold over the inverse fiber. attackers' is the preimage of targets, and Hits += #/ attackers' counts in-edges per target — hits row 4 says 2 where the scatter said once.
--! registry ../registries/s05a-frenzy-image.reg
--! expect frenzied = 0 0 0 1 1 1 0 0
--! expect health = 100 100 100 90 90 90 100 100
--! expect hits = 0 0 0 1 2 1 0 0

Frenzy.targets' , +Frenzied ; Health -= 10
Target , Hits += #/ attackers'
